Description: Open-source file viewer built with Python/PyQt
 Vibevi is a two-panel file viewer with a file tree on the right
 and a content viewer on the left. Supports sorting by date, name,
 and file type. Renders txt, doc/docx, jpeg, png, avi, and more
 programmatically without external applications.
